# Line endings are pinned in-repo so they do not depend on each machine's
# core.autocrlf. This tree round-tripped through Windows once (2026-08) and
# came back entirely CRLF, which made all 54 changed files read as rewritten.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch. The tracked PNG contains raw CR bytes.
*.png    binary
*.npy    binary
*.gguf   binary
*.safetensors binary
